# Privacy Policy for Gemini Conversation Archiver

**Effective Date:** July 30, 2026

Gemini Conversation Archiver ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This privacy policy explains how our browser extension handles your information.

### Information Collection and Storage
* **Local Storage Only:** The extension stores your archived conversation metadata (such as chat IDs, custom titles, and URLs) exclusively in your browser's local storage (`chrome.storage.local`).
* **No External Transmission:** We do not collect, transmit, sync, or share your personal data, chat contents, or browsing history with any external servers, third parties, or databases. All data remains entirely on your local device.

### Permissions
* **Storage:** Used solely to save and load your archived conversation list locally.
* **Host Permissions (gemini.google.com):** Required to inject the user interface elements (archive buttons) into the Google Gemini web application.

### Changes to This Policy
We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted by updating the effective date of this policy.

### Contact Us
If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can reach out via our extension's repository or support page.
